#: .dashboard.verdict.released
msgid "Released — this is what you install."
msgstr "Publitgà – quai è quai che Vus installais."

#: .dashboard.verdict.released.detail
msgid "Every package built, every signature verified, and the whole set replaced the repository your system updates from."
msgstr "Mintga pachet è vegnì construì, mintga signatura verifitgada, e l’entira collecziun ha remplazzà il repositori dal qual Voss sistem vegn actualisà."

#: .dashboard.verdict.testFailed
msgid "Held in testing — the installation test failed."
msgstr "Retegnì en test – il test d’installaziun n’è betg reussì."

#: .dashboard.verdict.testFailed.detail
msgid "Every package built and was signed, but an unattended installation of the set did not succeed, so it was not released. Your system still installs the previous release."
msgstr "Mintga pachet è vegnì construì e signà, ma in’installaziun senza surveglianza da la collecziun n’è betg reussida, perquai n’è ella betg vegnida publitgada. Voss sistem installescha anc adina la versiun precedenta."

#: .dashboard.verdict.inTesting
msgid "In testing, not yet released."
msgstr "En test, anc betg publitgà."

#: .dashboard.verdict.inTesting.detail
msgid "Every package built and was signed, and the set is in the testing repository awaiting a check. Your system still installs the previous release."
msgstr "Mintga pachet è vegnì construì e signà, e la collecziun è en il repositori da test, nua ch’ella spetga ina controlla. Voss sistem installescha anc adina la versiun precedenta."

#: .dashboard.verdict.built
msgid "Built, not yet signed."
msgstr "Construì, anc betg signà."

#: .dashboard.verdict.built.detail
msgid "The build host holds no signing key. Signing and publishing happen afterwards on a separate machine."
msgstr "Il host da build n’ha nagina clav da signatura. La signatura e la publicaziun han lieu pli tard sin ina maschina separada."

#: .dashboard.verdict.heldBack
msgid "Held back — nothing shipped."
msgstr "Retegnì – nagut furnì."

#: .dashboard.verdict.heldBack.detail
msgid "One package did not pass, so the whole set stayed where it was. A partial update is never shipped."
msgstr "In pachet n’ha betg passà la controlla, perquai è l’entira collecziun restada nua ch’ella era. In’actualisaziun parziala na vegn mai furnida."

#: .dashboard.verdict.incomplete
msgid "Run incomplete."
msgstr "Execuziun incumpletta."

#: .dashboard.verdict.incomplete.detail
msgid "The record was written before the run reached a verdict."
msgstr "Il register è vegnì scrit avant che l’execuziun haja cuntanschì ina decisiun."

